}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"3c11526e-e215-4f8d-8378-e467cf6ac489"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Surface-like graphs", "GuideFunctionsSubsection",ExpressionUUID->"43d485c0-bccf-48c9-adb2-809e2971bd1c"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["TessellationCurvature",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the combinatorial Gaussian curvature at a vertex of a regular \
or uniform map; its sign says spherical, flat or hyperbolic"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"6bc936a4-a899-452c-aa61-5329a41b02c4"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["TessellationEulerCharacteristic",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the Euler characteristic V - E + F of a tessellation graph"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"591da1ac-ec64-4725-9d69-fbdf6ee56755"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["TessellationGenus",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the orientable genus of a tessellation graph, from its Euler \
characteristic"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"f6407ebb-a004-477f-932f-fa4989e8daba"],

Cell["\<\
waits: a test whether a graph is surface-like at a scale, its metric balls \
discs and its metric shells cycles\
\>", "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"c22dd375-e798-4ec9-8440-fbd1fb47dd9e"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Preparing a substrate", "GuideFunctionsSubsection",ExpressionUUID->"00d24ce5-f522-4653-9453-3b756b08aad5"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["CenterGraph",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the substrate cut to the ball of k hops about its centre; a \
negative k counts back from the radius, Scaled[q] takes a fraction of it"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"136649fa-5997-49c5-8c53-19b2739e93c6"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["BoundarylessGraph",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] deletes every edge joining two rim vertices and then the \
vertices this isolates, an open window onto the geometry"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"15fb9a8d-6cf7-4bff-a80f-03f9e846de86"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["GraphExteriorBoundary",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the rim vertices of the whole graph, detected from vertex \
degrees"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"e757a6f3-c122-45ce-9a54-c7e239c3cd9b"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

